_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q7wu-QKrUK4Q7kNvwECMo4Q&_nc_oc=Ado0s3aftGdI9wj0N7laM51TzfJM66NxGTsfMCyizezAscOzryy56Dy_ppC1FMqw0Mc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTHqJVMFze3oqUHiwhIMqFMYZ6GDmyoqbLlkp4Ul79X8g&oe=6B0C6541"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_03_driver_box_2560x1440.png", "id": "28993356633653725", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604360590_28993356640320391_8967486086715680885_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AaGvgmGWtgcQ7kNvwH2puAX&_nc_oc=Adr1x6RaPgNXNopBsdAj_CdDscvF-8G5pixckTYUYDNGdWoXvQUTN0mfDHHQizbeluc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS4b4SYio4BdhAuDQUO2tdfIsgdjFRKp6ZqxBoSLX-Mow&oe=6B0C7B2D"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_05_garage_2560x1440.png", "id": "1159762416478972", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_1159762419812305_9147251132373085083_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FEamq4HfWPwQ7kNvwHdwDyJ&_nc_oc=Adpxv4EjsJRtUQS9x8mMzQP_Xb4DYimDLn-HeVPbeDxYqa_rzUW1aZBnFPdZeLapOhY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRTs4Iy3AqL8iK2A-s6lHApv1s8DDH0m54VslmtSVNCYw&oe=6B0C6474"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "TITAN BRAWL: Battle Arena VR", "keywords": ["Robots", "Combat", "Arena", "Building", "Action"], "long_description": "TITAN BRAWL puts you in the driver's box of a roaring robot-combat arena. Pick up the TX-9 transmitter, push the stick where you want to go and pull the trigger: your robot does the rest, live, behind bulletproof glass.\n\nBUILD YOUR FIGHTER\n\u2022 Snap parts on at the garage cradle: chassis, drive, armour, power cell, control board\n\u2022 14 weapon types: vertical discs, drums, flippers, crushers, hammers, saws, swords, a Tesla clamp and more\n\u2022 Twin-weapon builds, flamethrowers, ice and water cannons\n\u2022 Paint shop: patterns, stickers, numbers, spray paint\n\nFEEL EVERY HIT\n\u2022 Armour panels dent, wheels and weapons tear off and fly\n\u2022 Batteries catch fire, oil leaks and burns\n\u2022 Bullet-time knockouts and instant replays on the big screen\n\nFIGHT YOUR WAY TO THE TOP\n\u2022 Career through five tiers against 13 rival robots and their drivers\n\u2022 5 arenas with drop pits, floor saws, flame vents, crushers and Tesla pylons\n\u2022 Quick bouts, challenges, gauntlet waves, 8- and 16-robot tournaments\n\u2022 An academy and an on-screen coach teach the controls step by step\n\nPLAY YOUR WAY\n\u2022 Standing or seated; no artificial locomotion\n\u2022 Easy, Arcade, Tank and Pro drive schemes, left-handed layout\n\u2022 Touch controllers; hand tracking supported\n\u2022 English, T\u00fcrk\u00e7e, Deutsch, Fran\u00e7ais, Espa\u00f1ol", "short_description": "Step into the driver's box and fight with a remote-controlled combat robot you built yourself. Rip off wheels and weapons, set batteries on fire, flip rivals into the pit and climb from the Rookie Circuit to the Titan Championship while the crowd roars. You stand still at the glass and drive with a real transmitter in your hands: no artificial movement."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/cemgamedev/cemgamedev/blob/main/privacy/titan-brawl-battle-arena-vr.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Totos Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tolgakalaycioglu.com/totosgame/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb